    {
      "source": "Converts the given result set (as a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>&lt;String,Object&gt;&gt;) to this converter's type\nor throws <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalArgumentException</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定的结果集（类型为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>List</code></a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Map</code></a>&lt;String,Object&gt;&gt;）转换为该转换器的类型，否则抛出<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>IllegalArgumentException</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
